      "explanation": "$f(2) = 7$, then $f(7) = 2 \\times 7 + 3 = 17$. The answer 10 stops after adding 3 once, 13 applies $f$ to 2 twice by adding rather than composing, and 34 doubles the result by applying $f$ a third time.",
